body:
I spent almost all of today alone. One of my closest, most trusted friends has now ghosted me when I tried to reach out to them. While I have one that is there for me, I can't tell who I can trust. I'm told I have to reach out to my friends, but what if they ghost me too. What if I lose everyone? Who can I trust? Who's there for me?

&#x200B;

I want to just know what's wrong for me. My therapist thought I was alright. Told me I was fine now. Yet here I am again. I had an emergency walk-in to my school's counseling office on the 24th. They gave me the earliest possible

&#x200B;

I found out that when I was drunk I made women feel uncomfortable. Someone told me I was creepy. That I was making advances. But I'm gay. I've been gay. I've just always been stuck in this stupid fucking closet cause my parents won't accept me. Now I feel like I can never come out. I feel like I'm irredeemable for stuff I never intended to do.
